  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "資訊與網路安全",
    "sub_ename": "INFORMATION AND NETWORK SECURITY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將介紹網路安全基本觀念及相關技術，並設計相關的實習課程，其課程內容包含網路與資訊安全簡介、電子郵件之安全性、網路基礎知識與防火牆、IP安全機制、無線網路安全機制、Web安全性、入侵偵測與惡意軟體。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces students to concepts and practices of network security and related technology. The chief subjects covered include: network and information security; electronic mail security; fundamental network knowledge and firewall; IP Security; wireless network security; Web security; and intrusion detection and malicious software.",
    "pre_subname": "IECS3052密碼學、IECS2004通訊與網路概論",
